
"smart_sources:2026-04-10 - Illegal clauses in Idaho leases pose serious risks for renters and nonprofits • Idaho Capital Sun.md": {"path":"2026-04-10 - Illegal clauses in Idaho leases pose serious risks for renters and nonprofits • Idaho Capital Sun.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"syyoaf","at":1785795032103},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783470359374,"size":5194,"at":1785795032194,"hash":"syyoaf"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"##Illegal clauses in Idaho leases pose serious risks for renters and nonprofits":[10,29],"##Illegal clauses in Idaho leases pose serious risks for renters and nonprofits#{1}":[12,29],"##A tenant has the right to quiet enjoyment of a unit.":[30,33],"##A tenant has the right to quiet enjoyment of a unit.#{1}":[32,33],"##A landlord cannot confiscate personal property. (Idaho Code 6-302)":[34,37],"##A landlord cannot confiscate personal property. (Idaho Code 6-302)#{1}":[36,37],"##A landlord cannot have a tenant sign away the right to trial by jury. (Idaho Code 6-313)":[38,41],"##A landlord cannot have a tenant sign away the right to trial by jury. (Idaho Code 6-313)#{1}":[40,41],"##A landlord must engage in the formal eviction process. Once an eviction has been processed by the court, the tenant has 72 hours to move out. (Idaho Code 6-304, 6-316)":[42,46],"##A landlord must engage in the formal eviction process. Once an eviction has been processed by the court, the tenant has 72 hours to move out. (Idaho Code 6-304, 6-316)#{1}":[44,46]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Matthias Aleksander Ryan","target":"Matthias Aleksander Ryan","line":5},{"title":"House keys sitting on an eviction notice received in the mail.","target":"https://idahocapitalsun.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/Eviction-notice-2048x1368.jpg","line":14,"embedded":true},{"title":"Jesse Tree","target":"https://www.jessetreeidaho.org/","line":20},{"title":"renter protections","target":"https://www.jessetreeidaho.org/trc","line":22},{"title":"Idaho Legal Aid","target":"https://idaholegalaid.org/","line":26},{"title":"Landlord and Tenant Manual","target":"https://www.ag.idaho.gov/content/uploads/2025/08/LandlordTenant.pdf","line":32}],"metadata":{"title":"Illegal clauses in Idaho leases pose serious risks for renters and nonprofits • Idaho Capital Sun","source":"https://idahocapitalsun.com/2026/04/10/illegal-clauses-in-idaho-leases-pose-serious-risks-for-renters-and-nonprofits/?emci=6987a276-6734-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&emdi=62ef36dd-d434-f111-8ef2-000d3a14b640&ceid=110103","author":["[[Matthias Aleksander Ryan]]"],"published":"2026-04-10","created":"2026-07-07","description":"Jesse Tree case managers are trained to understand renter protections and leases that don’t uphold Idaho law, writes Matthias Aleksander Ryan."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},